        "title": "In the modern world, it is possible to shop, work and communicate online and live without any face-to-face contact with others. Is this a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>In the modern world, it is possible to shop, work and communicate online and live without any face-to-face contact with others. Is this a positive or negative development?</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Online Life vs Face-to-Face Interaction&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RweDdoI8UomokOxTknVlfh7XgVb\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Đề Online Life vs Face-to-Face Interaction&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> Trong thế giới hiện đại, con người c&oacute; thể mua sắm, l&agrave;m việc, giao tiếp trực tuyến v&agrave; sống m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng cần bất kỳ sự tiếp x&uacute;c trực tiếp n&agrave;o với người kh&aacute;c.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LaMpdLdiZomLoBxBRe9lu13TgJe\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một sự ph&aacute;t triển t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Online Life vs Face-to-Face Interaction&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q17DdVld5ovfxWxIPPjljtuOgte\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>the contemporary digital era (<em>kỷ nguy&ecirc;n số đương đại</em>)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FXbrdYH7ao8k13xNT3ElsH7sgVf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>digital platforms (<em>nền tảng số</em>)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UKjmd5daloD6EIxBlsnlQaH6gjc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>physical interactions (<em>tương t&aacute;c trực tiếp</em>)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực hơn l&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QXNedvQi4oToyux0vxalTXzBgcd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c <strong>mặt ti&ecirc;u cực</strong> của việc sống ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n online (chiếm 40% độ d&agrave;i).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TIpOd4794otRJ9x88bWljUqxgUb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Nhấn mạnh c&aacute;c <strong>lợi &iacute;ch vượt trội</strong> của xu hướng n&agrave;y, khẳng định đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một sự ph&aacute;t triển t&iacute;ch cực (chiếm 60% độ d&agrave;i).</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y c&aacute;c mặt ti&ecirc;u cực của việc sống ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n online.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B26bdn7esoz6aRxx9JQlgtuOgtf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> </span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, việc sống ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n trực tuyến c&oacute; thể dẫn đến một số vấn đề đ&aacute;ng lo ngại li&ecirc;n quan đến <em>ph&uacute;c lợi x&atilde; hội (social wellbeing)</em> v&agrave; <em>an ninh số (digital security)</em>.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mn25dQdBKo78Bqxyr7mlISPwgH9\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQMfdfSq7oxn7Px2e9llfCLdgac\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Việc thiếu <em>giao tiếp trực tiếp (face-to-face communication)</em> c&oacute; nghĩa l&agrave; mọi người bỏ lỡ <em>c&aacute;c t&iacute;n hiệu cảm x&uacute;c (emotional cues)</em> v&agrave; <em>ng&ocirc;n ngữ cơ thể (body language)</em> quan trọng, những yếu tố thiết yếu để x&acirc;y dựng c&aacute;c mối quan hệ c&oacute; &yacute; nghĩa.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWKZdLRRYoFOdnxmq4tl9ANogzG\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Sự thiếu hụt kết nối con người thực sự n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể dẫn đến cảm gi&aacute;c c&ocirc; lập v&agrave; c&ocirc; đơn, c&oacute; khả năng g&oacute;p phần v&agrave;o c&aacute;c <em>vấn đề sức khỏe t&acirc;m thần (mental health problems)</em> như trầm cảm.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NGdEdk7WboayNvxbO6zlclP1gl9\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EByTdklwdoXBU0xKSSIlPqeTgdf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Việc thực hiện tất cả hoạt động trực tuyến đ&ograve;i hỏi chia sẻ th&ocirc;ng tin c&aacute; nh&acirc;n tr&ecirc;n nhiều nền tảng kh&aacute;c nhau, điều n&agrave;y l&agrave;m tăng nguy cơ <em>r&ograve; rỉ dữ liệu (data breaches)</em> v&agrave; <em>đ&aacute;nh cắp danh t&iacute;nh (identity theft)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GVJnduZouox0ScxwLLwlJYFtgog\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Những mối <em>đe dọa an ninh mạng (cybersecurity threats)</em> như vậy c&oacute; thể dẫn đến thiệt hại t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh đ&aacute;ng kể v&agrave; khiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n dễ bị tổn thương trước nhiều h&igrave;nh thức <em>tội phạm mạng (cybercrime)</em> kh&aacute;c nhau.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về c&aacute;c lợi &iacute;ch vượt trội của lối sống trực tuyến.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W7XNd4x7DokFWsxWtpelDqE1gzt\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> </span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, c&oacute; vẻ như những bất lợi n&agrave;y bị lấn &aacute;t ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n bởi những ưu điểm.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jwp2ddfVKod1DWxSXwClnTdYgAd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBfMdTdD9ofszfxVX8SlebZlgbd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> <em>Sự tiện lợi v&agrave; hiệu quả (convenience and efficiency)</em> đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; cuộc sống trực tuyến mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AA9IdfAdvoUZraxo6Q6lyLVxglg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Kh&ocirc;ng cần phải di chuyển đến <em>c&aacute;c địa điểm vật l&yacute; (physical locations)</em>, mọi người c&oacute; thể tiết kiệm đ&aacute;ng kể <em>thời gian đi lại (commuting time)</em> v&agrave; quản l&yacute; c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng việc h&agrave;ng ng&agrave;y từ sự thoải m&aacute;i trong nh&agrave;, tạo ra <em>một th&oacute;i quen được sắp xếp hợp l&yacute; (streamlined routine)</em> hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wt5PdhiRqoznJXxMvlblpNmegUe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ElLtdyEavoANiMxSfMZlBJgzgKh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Một lợi &iacute;ch quan trọng kh&aacute;c l&agrave; <em>kết nối to&agrave;n cầu (global connectivity)</em> v&agrave; cơ hội chưa từng c&oacute; m&agrave; n&oacute; mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OGwYdf31EoZFuJxC8HFlCyjbgnf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example + Impact:</strong> C&aacute; nh&acirc;n giờ đ&acirc;y c&oacute; thể kết nối với mọi người tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n thế giới, tiếp cận<em> thị trường việc l&agrave;m quốc tế (international job markets)</em>, v&agrave; học hỏi từ c&aacute;c <em>chuy&ecirc;n gia to&agrave;n cầu (global experts)</em>, từ đ&oacute; mở rộng <em>triển vọng nghề nghiệp (career prospects)</em> của họ ra xa hơn những giới hạn địa phương.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yfb6dNJURoxnBox2iBblLgczg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>living entirely online<em> (sống ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n trực tuyến)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JIMGdPX81o8zLbxOXrhlJz5dgVe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">social isolation and security risks <em>(c&ocirc; lập x&atilde; hội v&agrave; rủi ro an ninh)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1704,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>In the contemporary era, technological advancements have made it feasible for individuals to conduct most of their daily activities through digital platforms without requiring physical interactions. Although this trend may lead to certain drawbacks, I believe the benefits it offers are far more significant.</p>",
            "question_id": 18265,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1705,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>Admittedly, living entirely online can result in some concerning issues related to social wellbeing and digital security.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Regarding the former, the absence of face-to-face communication means people miss important emotional cues and body language, which are essential for building meaningful relationships. This lack of genuine human connection can lead to feelings of isolation and loneliness, potentially contributing to mental health problems such as depression. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">As for the latter, conducting all activities online requires sharing personal information on various platforms, which increases the risk of data breaches and identity theft. Such cybersecurity threats can result in significant financial losses and make individuals vulnerable to various forms of cybercrime.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 18265,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1706,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, it seems that these disadvantages are far outweighed by the advantages.</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"> One of them is the remarkable convenience and efficiency that online living provides. Without the need to travel to physical locations, people can save considerable commuting time and manage their daily tasks from the comfort of their homes, creating a more streamlined routine.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"> Another significant benefit is the unprecedented global connectivity and opportunities it offers. Individuals can now connect with people worldwide, access international job markets, and learn from global experts, thereby expanding their career prospects far beyond local limitations.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 18265,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1707,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, while living entirely online might involve certain problems related to social isolation and security risks, I believe its benefits in terms of convenience and global opportunities are more substantial.</p>",
            "question_id": 18265,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
